  _subtitle: Chapters 15 and 16
  _description: 'Back in the [[9d4c77c2-5244-4449-b2ef-0ed428ada08e|Emerald City]],
    the Wizard turns out to be a humbug. He keeps his promises anyway: [[76e18d10-2bf0-4a20-91ef-ad04491e3893|Brains]],
    a [[5100c79b-420f-4ab8-a145-69066e451114|Heart]] and [[49e93e91-2e01-4f55-a77d-7deda9d66e74|Courage]].'
